      "rendered": "<p>The first wave of the pandemic had struck the economy with a devastating impact. While everyone was expecting a great rebound in 2021, the corona virus has been planning it&#8217;s own war with the entrepreneurs. A business is not just a source of livelihood for an entrepreneur but a sense of identity. Losing this identity [&hellip;]</p>\n",
